janus (0.1.5-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * First Debian/Ubuntu package (Ubuntu 24.04 and flavours such as Kubuntu).
  * Native Google Cast, AirPlay and Hisense/EShare casting of a screen or one
    window, with optional desktop sound and GPU H.264 encoding.
  * Receivers show this computer as janus@<hostname>.
  * Rounded, non-maximizing window with segmented source/navigation controls.

